{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4bdb808ffdefe04947f298cf78e26252c99e0e23917c27c1745410a9b4955313", "ja": "（今日は亜美の『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nチャイナ服で元気いっぱいかと思ったが、大人しいな）", "zh": "（今天是亚美拍摄《偶像写真！！》的日子。\n本以为她穿着旗袍会活力十足，没想到还挺安静的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "abec86febc682a14d9ff4b27b32a9df3a93773ced636cbfcd6bdd9d134430fdd", "ja": "ううぅ……兄ちゃん、助けて～……。\n亜美、超ピンチだよ～……。", "zh": "呜呜……哥哥，救救我～……\n亜美现在超级危急～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c196f52d73e175bf09aecf4c087bdb7c5bc7e8b6f677429b7b1f0a417bfca39a", "ja": "い、いったいどうしたんだ？　声に力も無いし……\nもしかして、体調が悪いとか……？", "zh": "这、这到底是怎么了？声音听起来也有气无力的……\n难道说，是身体不舒服吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "6e6d00865e1f3b4abcc6c23019d5a6e2cd8dd9bf8731257c6e046c701a25ceb8", "ja": "あのね、亜美……今にも、お布団の中にダイブ\nしちゃいたいくらいなんだよ……。おネムだよ～。", "zh": "那个啊，亚美……现在就想直接扑进被窝里……困得不行啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4d40ce87b61bb615f348f61b6a6758bc11a9fb94c50fdfd70f596c0ea2a56b05", "ja": "なんだ、大人しかったのは、眠いからか？\nどうしてまた……。", "zh": "怎么，原来你这么安静，是因为困了吗？  \n怎么又来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "a55845bc10f2667bd8fc45b7a39212c50bd993c43a878c5997a5dc8b8fe0b36d", "ja": "亜美にチャイナ服を選んでくれたってことは、やっぱ\n兄ちゃんも亜美にせくしーを求めてるってことっしょ？", "zh": "哥哥给亚美挑了旗袍，也就是说，哥哥果然也想让亚美性感一点，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "1f2895a2101dd289e3ea4336fbd0dc3d2451d70f2aaee1fbecd39c9d3d36f647", "ja": "それで亜美、考えたんだ。チャイナ服で\nせくしーと言えば、やっぱ中国拳法の達人っしょ？", "zh": "所以亚美就想了想。说到穿旗袍的性感形象，果然还是中国拳法大师最合适吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "2a50b71067dba182c9997af647c98e38102fbef583a0c6d0a14fd9a63cba9b19", "ja": "だから、拳法のゴクイを学ぶために格闘ゲームで\nトックンしてたら……朝になってたんだよね～。", "zh": "所以，为了学习拳法的奥义，我在格斗游戏里特训，练着练着就到早上了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e50cef3dfcf9132844ea5c55452add1392ff51ae488862652f2ee64e0d0055b2", "ja": "つまり、徹夜でゲームして遊んでて寝不足だと……。\nまあでも、亜美なりに努力したのはわかったよ。", "zh": "也就是说，你熬夜玩游戏，结果睡眠不足了……  \n不过，我明白你也为此付出了自己的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "6bcdf409262bfda6e642d4a10c06d228f13ba7ea9293de8b5f789c4aa8f2b167", "ja": "あ～、遊んでたわけじゃないよ～……！\n今日のために、亜美はたくさんの敵と……ふわあ。", "zh": "啊～，才不是在玩啦～……！\n为了今天，亚美跟好多敌人……哈欠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7b9fc9148d65a3ba809adfff2aa00953306c60b9d01e4653b2893c0af2b5852a", "ja": "このままだと、撮影中に眠りかねないな……。\nでも、今こそ特訓の成果を見せる時だぞ！　亜美！", "zh": "照这样下去，拍摄时说不定会睡着……。\n不过，现在正是展现特训成果的时候！亜美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "3a7b9912a7b8a5f7217b99bd07299a0dab8a7772c6bd2de44cd5c39a3efc990b", "ja": "ん～……トックンの成果？　何のトックンの\n成果だっけ？　亜美、眠くて記憶が……。", "zh": "嗯～……特训的成果？ 是什么特训的成果来着？亚美困得都想不起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1e975dad3eb66624dd671c31f12729f75fdc09d065a321fc47282c8b87856018", "ja": "中国拳法だろ！？　辛い特訓に耐えた亜美は\nもう立派な中国拳法マスターなはずだ！", "zh": "是中国武术吧！？经受住了艰苦特训的亚美，现在应该已经是出色的中国武术大师了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5e357522b87767efbbbc0d0ba446a2dc64799887a3e5ef70dcd7a60119f489b3", "ja": "今こそ、溢れ出るセクシーなオーラを見せてくれ！\n敵との戦いを忘れたのか！", "zh": "现在正是时候，把你浑身散发出的性感气场展现出来！你难道忘了和敌人的战斗吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "04bc7704c952655c17c176fd96195ffd212ab1ca11cf318b7855889c7c977084", "ja": "ハッ！？　そうだった！　亜美は全身から\nメッチャすごいオーラが出るようになったんだった！", "zh": "哈！？对了！亜美现在能从全身散发出超厉害的气场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fcfc94fb430c6bc7518a26eae2a786dc7a85f107e6c2a23720f5ec99e06b39b1", "ja": "そうだぞ亜美、その意気だ！\nその力、撮影で存分に披露してくれ！", "zh": "就是这样，亚美，就是这股劲头！\n拍摄时尽情展示你的力量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "bfa3ff6eb52fa8c5b853a832e4217773bdeee2d6b7caeff18867867d080e9b84", "ja": "んっふっふ～。ついに亜美のメチャカワ拳つよつよ流\n奥義を披露する時がやってきたみたいだね！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～。看来终于到了展示亚美超可爱拳超强流\n奥义的时候了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0263_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "156127f4bceccf8415920321697b706457e0907eb65ac4054b62699977118303", "ja": "よーし、兄ちゃん！　亜美の必殺ちらりずむで、\nみんなをトリコにしてくるよ！", "zh": "好——哥哥！我要用亚美的必杀绝技“偷偷瞄瞄”，把大家迷得神魂颠倒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
